Subject: gpu bind each selected Venus context to exact native GPU UUIDs
Why: AC-T7.4.1: each Venus context of a selected VM is bound to the exact native GPU UUIDs of its selection, through virglrenderer 1.3.0's physical-device filter and the selector transport to its render server (resources/gpu/physical-*.patch, which scripts/gpu-libs applies) and the native identity bridge (resources/gpu/native-identity.c), so a guest renders on its selected GPU and on no other. Shards commits de0a0e6e and 0b6a4b40.

